The project-authored network-node icon replaces the earlier shield artwork.
Its geometry and reproducible assets are documented in
docs/BRAND_ASSET_PROVENANCE.md. It does not reproduce a NextDNS logo or
represent affiliation; final store presentation review remains pending.

The offline traffic-destination map includes simplified country-boundary
geometry derived from Natural Earth, 1:110m Cultural Vectors, Admin 0 –
Countries. Natural Earth states that its data are public domain. Source and
terms information are included in app/src/main/assets/licenses/world-map-NOTICE.txt.

